fastjj embeds a modified jj-cli 0.29.0 by The Jujutsu Authors under Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj/tree/v0.29.0

The vendored CLI is copied from the checksum-verified crates.io jj-cli 0.29.0
package. It retains upstream copyright and license notices. fastjj adds an
in-memory argument and configuration APIs and a native text-editor callback,
and removes standalone binary/test declarations from
the vendored manifest. The jj repository data model and storage code are
provided by the unmodified, version-pinned jj-lib dependency.
fastjj also replaces SSH transport with a native libgit2 smart transport, adds
SSH configuration/key/agent handling and thread-based jump tunnels, and updates
the vendored CLI's SSH error hint accordingly.
